  "description": "Vali-Mediator integration for Vali-Validation. Adds a ValidationBehavior<TRequest, TResponse>\n            that validates IRequest objects before they reach their handler.\n            When TResponse is Result<T>, validation failures are returned as Result.Fail(errors, ErrorType.Validation)\n            — no exceptions needed. For other response types, throws ValidationException.\n            Package name: Vali-Validation.ValiMediator. Requires Vali-Mediator.",
  "iconFile": "VV.png",
