  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.3 — Bug fixes and improvements:\n            - Fixed reflection in ValidationBehavior to properly extract ValidationErrors from Result<T> struct.\n            - Enhanced validation error extraction in Result conversion (updated BindingFlags for public properties).\n\n            v1.0.2 — Enhanced logging for debugging:\n            - Added diagnostic logging in ValidationBehavior to track validation execution.\n\n            v1.0.0 — Initial release of Vali-Validation.ValiMediator.\n            - ValidationBehavior<TRequest, TResponse> implementing Vali-Mediator IPipelineBehavior.\n            - Validates request via IValidator<TRequest> resolved from DI.\n            - When TResponse is Result<T>: returns Result.Fail(errors, ErrorType.Validation) — no throw.\n            - When TResponse is any other type: throws ValidationException.\n            - AddValiValidationBehavior() extension on ValiMediatorConfiguration.\n            - AddValiMediatorWithValidation() convenience extension on IServiceCollection.",
